# Lightning Studio (this machine)

- One conda env: `cloudspace`. Do not `conda create -n poseapp`.
- Node 26 must be on PATH for honcho. Studio wraps `node`/`npm` onto 22. Prepend `/teamspace/studios/this_studio/.nvm/versions/node/v26.9.0/bin` (or `nvm use 26`) and `unset -f node npm npx` if `ng` is missing.
- Daily UI: from `lightning-pose-app`, `honcho -f Procfile.dev start` → **http://localhost:4200** (Cursor forwards the port). `litpose run_app` needs `--host 0.0.0.0` and `./scripts/build/build_ui.sh` first.
- Smoke-test data (do not commit): `/teamspace/studios/this_studio/LPProjects/mirror-mouse-fused-tiny` and `/teamspace/studios/this_studio/LPProjects/mirror-mouse-fused`. Fused mouse data is single-view.
- GitHub CLI is `jmrfox`. Do not open PRs unless asked.
